# Generated mushaf assets — NOT committed (run `pnpm setup:quran` to build them).
# ~46MB of page data + per-page fonts, all reproducible from public sources +
# the committed scripts/data/*.sqlite. Keep the two hand-placed files below.
public/quran/pages/
public/quran/fonts/v1/
public/quran/meta/pages-all.json
public/quran/meta/verse-to-page.json
public/quran/meta/quran-structure.json
# Keep committed (not generated by the build): the ornamental surah-header font
# and the folder README.
!public/quran/fonts/surah-name/
!public/quran/README.md

# The QUL source SQLite exports (~2.7MB) ARE committed so `pnpm setup:quran`
